            "detailed_description": "<h1>A Note from the Developer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game first launched in 2017. As a title with a few years behind it, some of its views and wording may not hold up perfectly by today’s standards—thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I run a one-person studio with outsourcing support. Energy is limited, so maintenance and updates will be relatively slow. Please rest assured, though: the game will keep being maintained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it gave you a good time, a <strong>review</strong> would mean a lot to me. If something didn’t sit right, or you hit a bug, feel free to email me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your patience and support!</p></p><br><h1>Stalk the Dev</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam makes this easy now—you can find me via the links in the right-hand sidebar (including the QQ group and Discord). A few extras:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback email: <a href=\"mailto:wangmiaoyi.studio@gmail.com\">wangmiaoyi.studio@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official Taobao shop (merch): 王妙一工作室</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official website: </p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588040/extras/a766e7acdc788c3d7933115aee139a66.avif?t=1786850977\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✒️Have you heard this urban legend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a quiet corner of the city, a rumor still circulates:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your troubles on a scrap of paper. Hold it at midnight and pray—<strong>“God, please help me…”</strong>—and a god will hear you, and change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are that god, waking in a strange space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only companion is a talking dog (?), and a steady stream of letters from the human world. The writers come from everywhere, each standing at a turning point:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet nerd lost in a one-sided crush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A down-and-out painter teetering on the edge of despair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rookie cop burning for justice and a first real case</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young woman caught between her dreams and reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And… a stray cat who would be happy with nothing more than dried fish  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588040/extras/7f261acb75019f4d5c25fe498699ab16.avif?t=1786850977\" width=1000 height=593 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✒️Rewrite fate by cutting and rearranging the words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot descend to the mortal world. What you have is a single power: reassemble language, and rewrite reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read each letter, then freely drag and reorder the sequence of events—the cause and effect on the page.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Butterfly effect:</strong> Swap “take one step to the right” with “swing the racket,” and a brutal sports injury may become a perfect victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crossing fates:</strong> No life stands alone. Change one letter, and the ripples may quietly reach a stranger you have never met. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588040/extras/b4f4c8fe18d538ddad716052683820a5.avif?t=1786850977\" width=1000 height=1915 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✒️Every choice has a cost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say a god chooses for the greater good. But are these really the best choices for mortals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, there is no perfect answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp deduction and wild imagination are both fair game. Sometimes a ridiculous experiment unlocks an ending you never saw coming. Among countless combinations, find the path that leads to a <strong>“Wonderful World.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588040/extras/0aa4a46e6009e387826be0887c016c70.avif?t=1786850977\" width=573 height=493 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✒️Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A one-of-a-kind text-collage puzzle:</strong> Drag and rearrange the sentences in each letter—rewriting cause and effect is the game. Few titles play quite like this.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An ensemble, web-like story:</strong> Dozens of lives pull on one another; as perspectives shift, unexpected links come into view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A letter-driven narrative:</strong> Follow each ordinary person’s turns of fortune through text, illustrations, and music.</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588040/extras/a766e7acdc788c3d7933115aee139a66.avif?t=1786850977\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✒️Have you heard this urban legend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a quiet corner of the city, a rumor still circulates:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your troubles on a scrap of paper. Hold it at midnight and pray—<strong>“God, please help me…”</strong>—and a god will hear you, and change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are that god, waking in a strange space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only companion is a talking dog (?), and a steady stream of letters from the human world. The writers come from everywhere, each standing at a turning point:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet nerd lost in a one-sided crush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A down-and-out painter teetering on the edge of despair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rookie cop burning for justice and a first real case</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young woman caught between her dreams and reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And… a stray cat who would be happy with nothing more than dried fish  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588040/extras/7f261acb75019f4d5c25fe498699ab16.avif?t=1786850977\" width=1000 height=593 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✒️Rewrite fate by cutting and rearranging the words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot descend to the mortal world. What you have is a single power: reassemble language, and rewrite reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read each letter, then freely drag and reorder the sequence of events—the cause and effect on the page.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Butterfly effect:</strong> Swap “take one step to the right” with “swing the racket,” and a brutal sports injury may become a perfect victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crossing fates:</strong> No life stands alone. Change one letter, and the ripples may quietly reach a stranger you have never met. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588040/extras/b4f4c8fe18d538ddad716052683820a5.avif?t=1786850977\" width=1000 height=1915 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✒️Every choice has a cost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say a god chooses for the greater good. But are these really the best choices for mortals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, there is no perfect answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp deduction and wild imagination are both fair game. Sometimes a ridiculous experiment unlocks an ending you never saw coming. Among countless combinations, find the path that leads to a <strong>“Wonderful World.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588040/extras/0aa4a46e6009e387826be0887c016c70.avif?t=1786850977\" width=573 height=493 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✒️Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A one-of-a-kind text-collage puzzle:</strong> Drag and rearrange the sentences in each letter—rewriting cause and effect is the game. Few titles play quite like this.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An ensemble, web-like story:</strong> Dozens of lives pull on one another; as perspectives shift, unexpected links come into view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A letter-driven narrative:</strong> Follow each ordinary person’s turns of fortune through text, illustrations, and music.</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "“God, please help me…” Become a god and rewrite fate with words. Drag and reorder sentences from pleading letters to twist cause and effect, changing the lives of those who wrote them. When countless joys and sorrows collide, what kind of “Wonderful World” will you create?",
